<p>MIT AI Alignment (MAIA) is a student group working to reduce catastrophic risks from advanced AI. We support students through AI safety education, research, and career development.</p>
<p>Our community includes MIT undergraduate and graduate students, alongside researchers and students from across Boston. <a href="/getinvolved/">Get involved</a> through our fellowship, member meetings, workshops, and research programs.</p>
<p>MAIA is supported by the <a href="https://www.cbai.ai/">Cambridge Boston Alignment Initiative</a> (CBAI), with funding from <a href="https://coefficientgiving.org/">Coefficient Giving</a>. We work with <a href="https://aisst.ai/">AISST</a>, our sister AI safety group at Harvard.</p>
